{"id":"ocherednoj","lemma":"очередной","pos":"adj","rank":1965,"glosses":["next (in an order or sequence)","regular (of a regular occurrence according to a schedule)","another, yet another, just another, another routine, one more, (in the plural) more, yet more, etc."],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/a7/Ru-%D0%BE%D1%87%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%B4%D0%BD%D0%BE%D0%B9.ogg/Ru-%D0%BE%D1%87%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%B4%D0%BD%D0%BE%D0%B9.ogg.mp3","forms":{"neuter":"очередное","feminine":"очередная","plural":"очередные"},"examples":[{"text":"Том потерял очередной зонтик.","en":"Tom has lost another umbrella.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"to lose, to waste","l":"потерять"},null,{"g":"umbrella"}]},{"text":"Звучит как очередная ложь.","en":"That sounds like another lie.","words":[null,{"g":"how / like"},null,{"g":"lie"}]},{"text":"Они готовятся к очередной атаке.","en":"They're preparing for another attack.","words":[{"g":"they"},{"g":"to get ready","l":"готовиться"},{"g":"to"},null,null]},{"text":"Мне неинтересно выслушивать твои очередные теории.","en":"I'm not interested in hearing any more of your theories.","words":[{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},{"g":"uninterestingly"},{"g":"to hear out, to listen"},{"g":"your","l":"твой"},null,{"g":"theory","l":"теория"}]},{"text":"Местную кофейню заменил очередной Старбакс.","en":"The local coffee shop was replaced by a Starbucks.","words":[null,null,{"g":"to replace","l":"заменить"},null,null]}]}